; First start: the station's call. Replaces editing the settings file.
FORM SETUP
TITLE Your station
SUMMARY The first thing a box out of the can asks: your call. The box then makes its keys and card.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 10
ACTION setup_station
FIELD call Station call(X) required upper max=16 check=station
NEXT CARD_SEND BOOK CHANNEL
BEGIN_HELP
Station call:
Your MARS call, as the net knows you (STA-B). Letters, digits and -.
It can't be changed here once set, so check it before you send.
END
